 .------------------------------------.
 | Fluffy Net rules - please observe! |
 `------------------------------------'

 File attach limit = 75K. Must be virus checked too.

 Sig's are not to exceed 10 lines.

 Swearing whilst allowed must not run to extreme's in as much as
 it would upset other people!

 Only 1 BBS add per week, and you must have written at least ten
 messages for the week.

 Slagging, diss'ing, flaming is absolutely off limits. If you've
 got a problem with somebody, sort it out sensibly and not here!

 Ensure when quoting msgs, you delete blank lines and only quote
 the lines you are replying to. Become a proper msg writter.

 Show respect to other users and the network itself.


